fin-portfolio:DirectUnitValuationProfile a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "Direct Unit Valuation Profile, is the concrete valuation method profile that values a position by signed snapshot quantity multiplied by an exact direct-unit Money price, with contractMultiplier = 1 and forbidding par, accrued, inverse, notional, and multiplier fallback paths. This is where the previously global hard lock of directUnitPriceTimesQuantity lives; other ValuationMethodFamily profiles are not bound by these forbiddals.";
    rdfs:label "Direct Unit Valuation Profile";
    rdfs:subClassOf _:r_42ac9399e149508bce3f481a, _:r_d05c832980e42ea6a007424e, fin-portfolio:ValuationMethodFamily, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/data-binding/FactVersion>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/ProvenancedFact>, <https://axiolune.ai/ontology/meta/patterns/TemporalFact>.
